title: Raritan PX2 Devices External Sensors: Humidity
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/environment/raritan
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors humidity sensors connected to a Raritan PX2 device.
 No configuration is needed, the devices send their states by themselves.
 The levels for the check can be configured in the 'humidity' rule.
 Device thresholds are used only when their respective activation bits are set.

item:
 Sensor followed by the sensor ID and name, e.g. Sensor 1.
 The PDU ID is prefixed only when multiple PDUs are found, e.g. 1/Sensor 1.

discovery:
 One service is created for each sensor.
